  "details": "When accessing the main menu profile of another user within the same instance, their avatar undergoes an automatic reload from your point of view upon opening the menu. However, this process can lead to a discrepancy in the avatars displayed. Specifically, if the user has switched avatars at any time, the automatic reload may revert them to their previous avatar locally (or the first avatar they were using upon instance entry). Consequently, while the user perceives themselves correctly, you yourself may see them represented by the wrong avatar.",
